# local references
# Covers both spellings: the folders on disk currently use spaces, and the
# reference one ends in a trailing space, which git strips from an unescaped
# pattern. The wildcard handles that; the underscore forms cover a rename.
Design Mockups/
Design_Mockups/
Design Reference*/
Design_Reference*/

